<template><div class="page-content"><div class="content-title"><div><h1>积分与邀请规则</h1><p>配置积分获取、有效期及泰山游兑换限制</p></div><span class="live-badge"><i></i>规则运行中</span></div><div class="settings-grid"><section class="dash-card form-card"><div class="section-heading"><span>01</span><div><h3>积分获取规则</h3><p>好友完成有效注册后自动发放</p></div></div><div class="number-setting"><div><b>单次有效邀请积分</b><span>好友首次注册并绑定手机号</span></div><div><input type="number" v-model.number="config.points.inviteScore"><em>分</em></div></div><div class="number-setting"><div><b>积分有效期</b><span>从积分发放日期开始计算</span></div><div><input type="number" v-model.number="config.points.validDays"><em>天</em></div></div><div class="section-heading"><span>02</span><div><h3>泰山游兑换规则</h3><p>控制兑换门槛与资源库存</p></div></div><div class="number-setting" v-for="r in rules" :key="r.key"><div><b>{{r.name}}</b><span>{{r.desc}}</span></div><div><input type="number" v-model.number="config.points[r.key]"><em>{{r.unit}}</em></div></div><div class="enable-row"><div><b>启用积分活动</b><span>关闭后暂停积分发放与兑换</span></div><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" v-model="config.points.enabled"><i></i></label></div><button class="primary-btn" @click="$emit('save')">保存并立即生效</button></section><section><div class="dash-card rule-preview"><div class="preview-top"><span>当前用户预览</span><i>规则模拟器</i></div><div class="points-ring"><strong>{{demo}}</strong><small>可用积分</small></div><div class="progress-track"><i :style="{width:Math.min(demo/config.points.exchangeScore*100,100)+'%'}"></i></div><p v-if="demo<config.points.exchangeScore">还差 <b>{{config.points.exchangeScore-demo}}</b> 积分兑换泰山游</p><p v-else class="success-text">已达到兑换条件，可以立即兑换</p><input type="range" min="0" :max="config.points.exchangeScore+20" v-model.number="demo"><button :disabled="demo<config.points.exchangeScore">{{demo<config.points.exchangeScore?'积分不足，继续邀请':'立即兑换泰山游'}}</button></div><div class="dash-card formula"><h3>当前规则摘要</h3><p>每邀请 <b>1</b> 位有效新用户，邀请人获得 <strong>{{config.points.inviteScore}}</strong> 积分。</p><p>积满 <strong>{{config.points.exchangeScore}}</strong> 分可兑换一次泰山经典游，每年最多 <strong>{{config.points.yearlyLimit}}</strong> 次。</p><p>每月开放 <strong>{{config.points.monthlyStock}}</strong> 个名额，积分有效期为 <strong>{{config.points.validDays}}</strong> 天。</p></div></section></div></div></template>
<script setup>import{ref}from'vue';defineProps({config:Object});defineEmits(['save']);const demo=ref(68);const rules=[{key:'exchangeScore',name:'兑换所需积分',desc:'达到积分后开放兑换按钮',unit:'分'},{key:'yearlyLimit',name:'单人年度兑换上限',desc:'按自然年统计兑换次数',unit:'次'},{key:'monthlyStock',name:'月度兑换名额',desc:'所有用户共享当月库存',unit:'份'}]</script>
